# OBD-II mode 04 answered with responsePending before the positive response.
#
# The ECU sends 7F 04 78 first, so a clear that consumed one response would
# leave the 44 to leak into whatever runs next.
# IDs are informational: the fake adapter matches on the UDS payload.

T 700 04
R 7E8 7f 04 78
R 7E8 44
